```mermaid
graph TD
    Start([Start: AI 决策空间落点]) --> ProjectInfluence[投影威胁 Influence<br/>Stamp threat @ 300,0<br/>radius=200cm peak=10.0 linear]
    ProjectInfluence --> ValidateField{威胁场<br/>有效?}
    ValidateField -->|✓ center ~8.23| GenerateCandidates[EQS 生成候选<br/>RingGenerator<br/>radius=400cm count=16]
    
    GenerateCandidates --> TestDistance[Test 1: Distance<br/>preferNear goal<br/>weight=1.0]
    TestDistance --> TestInfluence[Test 2: Influence<br/>preferLow threat<br/>weight=2.0]
    
    TestInfluence --> ScoreAll[为每个候选计算<br/>score = dist分 + 2×安全分]
    ScoreAll --> SelectBest{Selection: Best}
    
    SelectBest -->|found| AssertRing{候选在环上?<br/>dist² ~160000}
    SelectBest -->|not found| Fail([FAIL: 无候选])
    
    AssertRing -->|✓| AssertThreat{威胁低?<br/>influence < 3.0}
    AssertRing -->|✗| Fail
    
    AssertThreat -->|✓| AssertAvoid{避开直线?<br/>|Y| > 50cm}
    AssertThreat -->|✗| Fail
    
    AssertAvoid -->|✓| Success([PASS:<br/>绕过威胁落点])
    AssertAvoid -->|✗| Fail
    
    style Success fill:#4a4,stroke:#282,stroke-width:3px
    style Fail fill:#a44,stroke:#822,stroke-width:3px
    style ProjectInfluence fill:#46a,stroke:#258,stroke-width:2px
    style GenerateCandidates fill:#46a,stroke:#258,stroke-width:2px
    style SelectBest fill:#a64,stroke:#852,stroke-width:2px
