## 分支覆盖

| 分支 | 触发条件 | 结果 |
|------|---------|------|
| ValidateField ✓ | threat field 成功投影且采样有效 | ✓ covered |
| SelectBest found | 至少一个候选未被过滤 | ✓ covered |
| SelectBest not found | 全部候选被过滤（本场景无此分支）| untested |
| AssertRing ✓ | 最佳候选距原点 ~400cm | ✓ covered |
| AssertThreat ✓ | 最佳候选威胁 < 3.0 | ✓ covered |
| AssertAvoid ✓ | 最佳候选 Y 偏离直线 > 50cm | ✓ covered |

**关键路径**：Start → ProjectInfluence → GenerateCandidates → TestDistance → TestInfluence → ScoreAll → SelectBest → AssertRing → AssertThreat → AssertAvoid → **Success** ✓
